OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe odd
OL,6,Flight shower could affect western
OL,7,Fcoasts overnight, though most inland
OL,8,Fareas will be dry with clear spells
OL,9,Fand patchy cloud. A comfortable night,
OL,10,Fwith temperatures lower than recently,
OL,11,Fand light to moderate westerly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FIsolated showers are possible
OL,14,Fduring the day, most likely in the
OL,15,Fmorning and again through the evening.
OL,16,FOtherwise there will be sunny spells
OL,17,Fand feeling pleasant in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
