OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells on Saturday with the odd light
OL,7,Fshower, mainly in the north. Generally
OL,8,Fdry and bright with hazy sunshine on
OL,9,FSunday. A chance of showery rain
OL,10,Fdeveloping on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
